<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS-DAY FOUR.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS-DAY FOUR.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women's singles results on the</p>
<p>fourth day of the French Open tennis tournament on Thursday.</p>
<p>Prefix number denotes seeding</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>14-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat Florencia Labat</p>
<p>(Argentina) 4-6 7-6 (7-5) 6-4</p>
<p>Nathalie Tauziat (France) beat Venus Williams (U.S.) 5-7  6-3</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>10-Mary Pierce (France) beat Patricia Hy-Boulais (Canada) 6-1</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p> Lisa Raymond (U.S.) beat Tamarine Tanasugarn (Thailand)   6-1</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Flora Perfetti (Italy) beat Lea Ghirardi-Rubbi (France) 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Anna Kournikova (Russia) beat Sandra Cecchini (Italy) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Gloria Pizzichini (Italy)</p>
<p>3-6 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Kimberly Po (U.S.) beat Yuka Yoshida (Japan) 6-3 6-0</p>
<p>16-Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat Wang Shi-Ting (Taiwan) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>3-Monica Seles (U.S.) beat Sarah Pitkowski (France) 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>6-Arantxa Sanchez-Vicario (Spain) beat Ai Sugiyama (Japan) 6-3</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat Magalie Lamarre (France) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>Silvia Farina (Italy) beat Petra Begerow (Germany) 6-4  6-2</p>
<p>Dominique Van Roost (Belgium) beat Emmanuelle Gagliardi</p>
<p>(Switzerland) 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>Sandrine Testud (France) beat Catalina Cristea (Romania) 6-0</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>12-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat Andrea Glass (Germany) 6-1</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>ENDS WOMEN'S RESULTS</p>
